    <description>재보험 Renewal 영업기회 생성 후, 관련된 하위 정보 생성-2차본(사용X)</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_ParentPlacementId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF ( ISBLANK ( {!Get_Placement.ParentPlacement__c} ), {!recordId}, {!Get_Placement.ParentPlacement__c} )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_TotalPeriod</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Placement.ExpirationDate__c} - {!Get_Placement.InceptionDate__c}</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_TransactionSeq</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Placement.TransactionSeq__c} + 1</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
